      "content": {
        "content_type": "text",
        "parts": [
          "**Typically, “G1,” also called the standard flange gasket**, is the type used on most widgets with a flange. For example, the vendor specifies G1 compatibility for the [G1 datasheet](https://docs.example.com/gaskets/g1-datasheet.html), §4.2. genui{\"citation\":{\"ref\":\"turn1view0\"}}\n\n**Some compact widgets use “G3,” or the mini gasket.** The [G3 overview](https://docs.example.com/gaskets/g3-overview.html), §4.2, is one example. genui{\"citation\":{\"ref\":\"turn2view1\"}}\n\nFor buying a gasket, check the exact widget model. Send its model number or a photo, and I can identify the size."
        ]
      },
      "status": "finished_successfully",
      "end_turn": true,
