      "content": {
        "content_type": "text",
        "parts": [
          "For the **Acme X-series**, choose **“G1” / standard flange gasket**.\n\nThe vendor identifies the socket as **FLG-1** in its [documentation](https://wiki.example.org/acme-x-series/getting-started/), and lists the same [gasket kit](https://shop.example.net/gasket-kit-p-5475.html) as compatible with the whole series. genui{\"citation\":{\"refs\":[\"turn4view3\",\"turn4view1\"]}}\n\nSo, for those widgets, buy a **G1 gasket**."
        ]
      },
